715" end="00:18.965">a </span><span begin="00:18.965" end="00:19.465">man </span><span begin="00:19.465" end="00:19.715">has </span><span begin="00:19.715" end="00:19.988">gotta </span><span begin="00:19.988" end="00:20.340">feel </span><span begin="00:20.340" end="00:20.652">with </span><span begin="00:20.652" end="00:21.152">it </span><span begin="00:21.152" end="00:21.652">（with </span><span begin="00:21.652" end="00:21.902">it </span><span begin="00:21.902" end="00:22.277">with </span><span begin="00:22.277" end="00:22.772">it）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.477" end="00:24.590"><span begin="00:22.477" end="00:23.028">I </span><span begin="00:23.028" end="00:23.277">don't </span><span begin="00:23.277" end="00:23.528">care </span><span begin="00:23.528" end="00:23.738">what </span><span begin="00:23.738" end="00:23.965">they </span><span begin="00:23.965" end="00:24.581">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.290" end="00:27.465"><span begin="00:24.290" end="00:24.840">I'm </span><span begin="00:24.840" end="00:25.090">not </span><span begin="00:25.090" end="00:25.386">gonna </span><span begin="00:25.386" end="00:25.652">pay </span><span begin="00:25.652" end="00:25.902">nobody's </span><span begin="00:25.902" end="00:27.458">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.165" end="00:31.403"><span begin="00:27.165" end="00:27.715">'Cos </span><span begin="00:27.715" end="00:27.965">it's </span><span begin="00:27.965" end="00:28.465">all </span><span begin="00:28.465" end="00:28.778">about </span><span begin="00:28.778" end="00:28.965">the </span><span begin="00:28.965" end="00:29.215">doll </span><span begin="00:29.215" end="00:29.528">in </span><span begin="00:29.528" end="00:29.840">me </span><span begin="00:29.840" end="00:31.399">（mmm）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.103" end="00:34.528"><span begin="00:31.103" end="00:33.090">I </span><span begin="00:33.090" end="00:33.340">wanna </span><span begin="00:33.340" end="00:33.653">freak </span><span begin="00:33.653" end="00:33.965">in </span><span begin="00:33.965" end="00:34.278">the </span><span begin="00:34.278" end="00:34.524">morning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.228" end="00:35.590"><span begin="00:34.228" end="00:34.778">Freak </span><span begin="00:34.778" end="00:35.028">in </span><span begin="00:35.028" end="00:35.278">the </span><span begin="00:35.278" end="00:35.582">evening</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.290" end="00:36.528"><span begin="00:35.290" end="00:35.903">Just </span><span begin="00:35.903" end="00:36.239">like </span><span begin="00:36.239" end="00:36.522">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.228" end="00:40.591"><span begin="00:36.228" end="00:38.465">I </span><span begin="00:38.465" end="00:38.716">need </span><span begin="00:38.716" end="00:38.903">a </span><span begin="00:38.903" end="00:39.153">rough </span><span begin="00:39.153" end="00:39.403">neck </span><span begin="00:39.403" end="00:39.653">brother </span><span begin="00:39.653" end="00:39.841">that </span><span begin="00:39.841" end="00:40.091">can </span><span begin="00:40.091" end="00:40.341">satisfy </span><span begin="00:40.341" end="00:40.591">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.291" end="00:43.341"><span begin="00:40.291" end="00:41.778">Just </span><span begin="00:41.778" end="00:42.028">for </span><span begin="00:42.028" end="00:43.341">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.041" end="00:46.279"><span begin="00:43.041" end="00:43.591">If </span><span begin="00:43.591" end="00:43.778">you </span><span begin="00:43.778" end="00:44.028">are </span><span begin="00:44.028" end="00:44.341">that </span><span begin="00:44.341" end="00:44.591">kind </span><span begin="00:44.591" end="00:44.841">of </span><span begin="00:44.841" end="00:46.278">man</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.979" end="00:48.653"><span begin="00:45.979" end="00:46.528">'Cos </span><span begin="00:46.528" end="00:46.716">I'm </span><span begin="00:46.716" end="00:46.966">that </span><span begin="00:46.966" end="00:47.216">kind </span><span begin="00:47.216" end="00:47.403">of </span><span begin="00:47.403" end="00:48.649">girl</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.353" end="00:51.779"><span begin="00:48.353" end="00:48.841">I've </span><span begin="00:48.841" end="00:49.114">gotta </span><span begin="00:49.114" end="00:49.341">freaky </span><span begin="00:49.341" end="00:49.591">secret </span><span begin="00:49.591" end="00:49.841">everybody </span><span begin="00:49.841" end="00:51.777">sing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.479" end="00:54.091"><span begin="00:51.479" end="00:52.029">'Cos </span><span begin="00:52.029" end="00:52.341">we </span><span begin="00:52.341" end="00:52.591">don't </span><span begin="00:52.591" end="00:52.779">give </span><span begin="00:52.779" end="00:53.029">a </span><span begin="00:53.029" end="00:53.216">damn </span><span begin="00:53.216" end="00:53.466">about </span><span begin="00:53.466" end="00:53.779">a </span><span begin="00:53.779" end="00:54.088">thing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.791" end="00:56.904"><span begin="00:53.791" end="00:54.341">Cos </span><span begin="00:54.341" end="00:54.654">I </span><span begin="00:54.654" end="00:54.841">will </span><span begin="00:54.841" end="00:55.091">be </span><span begin="00:55.091" end="00:55.341">a </span><span begin="00:55.341" end="00:55.529">freak </span><span begin="00:55.529" end="00:55.779">until </span><span begin="00:55.779" end="00:56.029">the </span><span begin="00:56.029" end="00:56.898">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.604" end="00:58.966"><span begin="00:56.604" end="00:57.529">Until </span><span begin="00:57.529" end="00:57.904">the </span><span begin="00:57.904" end="00:58.957">dawn</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.666" end="01:01.029"><span begin="00:58.666" end="00:59.216">And </span><span begin="00:59.216" end="00:59.466">we </span><span begin="00:59.466" end="00:59.842">can </span><span begin="00:59.842" end="01:00.092">all </span><span begin="01:00.092" end="01:00.279">through </span><span begin="01:00.279" end="01:00.529">the </span><span begin="01:00.529" end="01:01.026">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.729" end="01:04.115"><span begin="01:00.729" end="01:01.279">To </span><span begin="01:01.279" end="01:01.529">the </span><span begin="01:01.529" end="01:01.716">early </span><span begin="01:01.716" end="01:04.110">morn</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.815" end="01:06.467"><span begin="01:03.815" end="01:04.280">Come </span><span begin="01:04.280" end="01:04.592">on </span><span begin="01:04.592" end="01:04.779">and </span><span begin="01:04.779" end="01:05.029">we'll </span><span begin="01:05.029" end="01:05.280">take </span><span begin="01:05.280" end="01:05.467">you </span><span begin="01:05.467" end="01:05.717">around </span><span begin="01:05.717" end="01:05.967">the </span><span begin="01:05.967" end="01:06.466">hood</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.167" end="01:07.404"><span begin="01:06.167" end="01:06.717">On </span><span begin="01:06.717" end="01:06.904">a </span><span begin="01:06.904" end="01:07.154">gangster </span><span begin="01:07.154" end="01:07.398">lift</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.104" end="01:11.467"><span begin="01:07.104" end="01:09.467">'Cos </span><span begin="01:09.467" end="01:09.654">we </span><span begin="01:09.654" end="01:09.904">can </span><span begin="01:09.904" end="01:10.155">any </span><span begin="01:10.155" end="01:10.427">time </span><span begin="01:10.427" end="01:10.717">of </span><span begin="01:10.717" end="01:11.464">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.167" end="01:14.530"><span begin="01:11.167" end="01:11.717">It's </span><span begin="01:11.717" end="01:11.967">all </span><span begin="01:11.967" end="01:12.217">good </span><span begin="01:12.217" end="01:12.529">for </span><span begin="01:12.529" end="01:14.524">me</span></p><